{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And who are the ones going</b> Pharaoh said to Moses: Why do you seek so much to go? Do you think you will enter the land — who are the ones going (to enter the land)? For all will die in the wilderness except Joshua and Caleb. מי ומי ההלכים in gematria = כלב ובן נון. Moses answered: with our young and with our old we will go, for no decree was issued — not on one less than twenty years old and not on one more than sixty years old."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "The verse text reads ההולכים (as in the lemma) but the gematria citation reads ההלכים (defective yod); both forms preserved as they appear in the source."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:23.977287800Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}